<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>

    <p>
        Explore service opportunities in different areas where volunteers
        can contribute their time, skills, and efforts to make a positive
        difference in their communities.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <h2>Environmental</h2>
            <p>
                Projects focused on protecting and improving our environment
                through activities such as cleanups, recycling, conservation,
                tree planting, and environmental education.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Educational</h2>
            <p>
                Projects that support learning and personal development by
                providing educational resources, tutoring, mentoring,
                workshops, and other learning opportunities.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Community Service</h2>
            <p>
                Projects designed to strengthen communities by supporting
                local needs, assisting vulnerable individuals, improving
                public spaces, and encouraging volunteer participation.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Health and Wellness</h2>
            <p>
                Projects that promote physical, mental, and emotional
                well-being through health education, wellness activities,
                community outreach, and healthy lifestyle initiatives.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</main>

